<title>UK: BADMINTON-SUDIRMAN CUP WORLD TEAM CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-SUDIRMAN CUP WORLD TEAM CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW, Scotland. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>Sudirman Cup world team badminton championships on Monday:</p>
<p>Group 6A</p>
<p> Sri Lanka    4  Slovenia   1</p>
<p> Pakistan     3  Guatemala  2</p>
<p>Group 6B</p>
<p> South Africa 4  Mauritius  1</p>
<p> Israel	 3  Jamaica    2</p>
<p>Group 8</p>
<p> Lithuania    5  Chile	0</p>
<p> Armenia	3  Greece     2</p>
</text>
